      "@id": "https://data.datatourisme.fr/8e1c2888-ad56-31bc-9837-d0391b3eb40f",
      "dc:description": {
        "de": [
          "Informationen :\n\nProdukte: Brote, Gebäck\n\nTage der Öffnung:\n\nMontag bis Samstag von 6:30 bis 19:00 Uhr\n\nSonntag geschlossen\n \n Abholung:\nZum Mitnehmen während der Ladenöffnungszeiten\n\nBestellungen:\nTelefonische Bestellungen unter 03 21 23 17 88 möglich\n\n \n\n\ntabelle\n\t{mso-displayed-decimal-separator: \"\\\",\";\n\tmso-displayed-thousand-separator:\" \"; }\ntr\n\t{mso-height-source:auto;}\ncol\n\t{mso-width-source:auto;}\ntd\n\t{padding-top:1px;\n\tpadding-right:1px;\n\tpadding-left:1px;\n\tmso-ignore:padding;\n\tcolor:black;\n\tfont-size:12.0pt;\n\tfont-weight:400;\n\tfont-style:normal;\n\ttext-decoration:none;\n\tfont-family:Calibri, sans-serif;\n\tmso-font-charset:1;\n\ttext-align:allgemein;\n\tvertical-align:bottom;\n\tborder:none;\n\twhite-space:nowrap;\n\tmso-rotate:0;}\n.xl23\n\t{vertical-align:top;\n\tborder:.5pt hairline windowtext;}"
        ],
        "en": [
          "Information :\n\nProducts: breads, pastries\n\nOpening days:\n\nMonday to Saturday, 6.30am to 7pm\n\nClosed on Sunday\n \n Pick-up :\nTakeaway during store opening hours\n\nOrdering:\nOrder by phone 03 21 23 17 88\n\n \n\n\ntable\n\t{mso-displayed-decimal-separator:\"\\,\";\n\tmso-displayed-thousand-separator:\" \";}\ntr\n\t{mso-height-source:auto;}\ncol\n\t{mso-width-source:auto;}\ntd\n\t{padding-top:1px;\n\tpadding-right:1px;\n\tpadding-left:1px;\n\tmso-ignore:padding;\n\tcolor:black;\n\tfont-size:12.0pt;\n\tfont-weight:400;\n\tfont-style:normal;\n\ttext-decoration:none;\n\tfont-family:Calibri, sans-serif;\n\tmso-font-charset:1;\n\ttext-align:general;\n\tvertical-align:bottom;\n\tborder:none;\n\twhite-space:nowrap;\n\tmso-rotate:0;}\n.xl23\n\t{vertical-align:top;\n\tborder:.5pt hairline windowtext;}"
        ],
        "it": [
          "Ulteriori informazioni :\n\nProdotti: pane, pasticceria\n\nGiorni di apertura:\n\nDa lunedì a sabato dalle 6.30 alle 19.00\n\nChiuso la domenica\n \n Ritiro :\nDa asporto durante gli orari di apertura del negozio\n\nOrdini :\nLe ordinazioni possono essere effettuate telefonicamente al numero 03 21 23 17 88\n\n \n\n\ntabella\n\t{mso-displayed-decimal-separator:\"\\,\";\n\tmso-displayed-thousand-separator:\" \";}\ntr\n\t{mso-height-source:auto;}\ncol\n\t{mso-larghezza-sorgente:auto;}\ntd\n\t{padding-top:1px;\n\tpadding-destra:1px;\n\tpadding-left:1px;\n\tmso-ignore:padding;\n\tcolore:nero;\n\tfont-size:12.0pt;\n\tfont-weight:400;\n\tfont-style:normal;\n\ttext-decoration:none;\n\tfont-family:Calibri, sans-serif;\n\tmso-font-charset:1;\n\ttext-align:general;\n\tvertical-align:bottom;\n\tbordo:nessuno;\n\twhite-space:nowrap;\n\tmso-rotate:0;}\n.xl23\n\t{vertical-align:top;\n\tborder:.5pt hairline windowtext;}"
        ],
        "fr": [
          "Informations :\n\nProduits : pains, patisseries\n\nJours d'ouverture:\n\nDu lundi au samedi de 6h30 à 19h\n\nFermeture le dimanche\n \n Retrait :\nÀ emporter aux horaires d'ouverture du magasin\n\nCommandes :\nPossibilité de commander par téléphone au 03 21 23 17 88\n\n \n\n\ntable\n\t{mso-displayed-decimal-separator:\"\\,\";\n\tmso-displayed-thousand-separator:\" \";}\ntr\n\t{mso-height-source:auto;}\ncol\n\t{mso-width-source:auto;}\ntd\n\t{padding-top:1px;\n\tpadding-right:1px;\n\tpadding-left:1px;\n\tmso-ignore:padding;\n\tcolor:black;\n\tfont-size:12.0pt;\n\tfont-weight:400;\n\tfont-style:normal;\n\ttext-decoration:none;\n\tfont-family:Calibri, sans-serif;\n\tmso-font-charset:1;\n\ttext-align:general;\n\tvertical-align:bottom;\n\tborder:none;\n\twhite-space:nowrap;\n\tmso-rotate:0;}\n.xl23\n\t{vertical-align:top;\n\tborder:.5pt hairline windowtext;}"
        ],
        "nl": [
          "Meer informatie :\n\nProducten: brood, gebak\n\nOpeningsdagen:\n\nMaandag tot zaterdag van 6.30 tot 19.00 uur\n\nZondag gesloten\n \n Afhalen :\nAfhalen tijdens openingstijden van de winkel\n\nBestellen :\nBestellingen kunnen telefonisch geplaatst worden op 03 21 23 17 88\n\n \n\n\ntabel\n\t{mso-displayed-decimal-separator:\",\";\n\tmso-displayed-duizend-scheidingsteken:\" \";}\ntr\n\t{mso-hoogtebron:auto;}\ncol\n\t{mso-breedtebron:auto;}\ntd\n\t{padding-top:1px;\n\tpadding-right:1px;\n\tpadding-left:1px;\n\tmso-ignore:padding;\n\tkleur:zwart;\n\tfont-size:12.0pt;\n\tfont-weight:400;\n\tfont-style:normal;\n\ttext-decoration:none;\n\tfont-family:Calibri, sans-serif;\n\tmso-font-charset:1;\n\ttext-align:general;\n\tverticaal-uitlijnen:onder\n\tborder:none;\n\twhite-space:nowrap;\n\tmso-rotate:0;}\n.xl23\n\t{vertical-align:top;\n\tborder:.5pt haarlijn windowtext;}"
        ],
        "es": [
          "Más información :\n\nProductos: pan, bollería\n\nDías de apertura:\n\nDe lunes a sábado de 6.30 a 19.00 horas\n\nDomingos cerrado\n \n Recogida :\nPara llevar durante el horario de apertura de la tienda\n\nPedidos :\nSe pueden hacer pedidos por teléfono llamando al 03 21 23 17 88\n\n \n\n\ntabla\n\t{mso-displayed-decimal-separator:\"\\,\";\n\tmso-displayed-thousand-separator:\" \";}\ntr\n\t{mso-height-source:auto;}\ncol\n\t{mso-width-source:auto;}\ntd\n\t{padding-top:1px;\n\tpadding-right:1px;\n\tpadding-left:1px;\n\tmso-ignore:padding;\n\tcolor:negro;\n\tfont-size:12.0pt;\n\tfont-weight:400;\n\tfont-style:normal;\n\ttext-decoration:none;\n\tfont-family:Calibri, sans-serif;\n\tmso-font-charset:1;\n\ttext-align:general;\n\tvertical-align:bottom;\n\tborde:ninguno\n\twhite-space:nowrap;\n\tmso-rotate:0;}\n.xl23\n\t{vertical-align:top;\n\tborder:.5pt hairline windowtext;}"
